{title: Amar Bhindeshi Tara}
{artist: Chondrobindu}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] amar vin deshi tara,        eka [C] rater e akashe
tumi [D] bajale aktara,        amar [G] chilekothar pashe
[G] thik shondha namar mukhe,        amar [C] naam dhore kew dake
mukh [D] lukea kar buke,        tomar [G] golpo bolo kake
[G] amar raat jaga taara,        tomar onno paray [Em] bari
amar [D] bhoy pawa cehara,        [G] ami adote anari
[G] amar akash dekha ghuri,        [G] kishu mitthe bahaduri
amar [D] chokh bedhe dao alo,        dao [C] shanto shitol pati
tumi [D] mayer motoi valo,        ami [G] eklati poth hati....
[G] amar bicchiri ek tara,        [C] tumi naona kotha kane
[D] tomar kisher eto tara,        rasta [G] par hobe sabdhane
[G] tomar gaye lagena dhulo,        [G] amar dumutho chal chulo
rakho [D] sorire haat jodi ar,        j [C] ol makho dui haate
plz [D] ghum hoye jao chokhe,        amar [G] mon kharaper raate
[G] amar raat jaga tara,        tomar [C] akash choya bari
ami [D] paina chute tomay,        amar [G] ekla lage bhari
